tem pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Biome\" title=\"Classic Biome\">Classic Biome</a> | Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$1,010</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Raw Chaos</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.57.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 6th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><big>\"A hidden deathtrap, waiting to be USED! Powered by purple goop &gt;:D\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Subspace Tripmine</b> is a special item bought in the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a> for $1,010. It is part of the random rotation in the store.\n</p><p>When used, the Subspace Tripmine plants a mine in front of the user, which when stationary, will turn invisible. \n</p><p>If stepped on by anybody with permissions on your base (including the user), the tripmine instantly explodes, killing those close to it and converting certain objects and schematics nearby temporarily pink with sparkles. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Only one mine can be placed by a person's tool at one time.</li>\n<li>This item can be used to ruin a person's grind (and day) by placing it in risky locations like the plank bridges near the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a>.</li>\n<li>Master trolling item.</li>\n<li>The Subspace Tripmine works and sounds incredibly similar to the original Roblox gear, the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/catalog/11999247/Subspace-Tripmine\">Subspace Tripmine</a>, however it is modified slightly.<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/catalog/11999247/Subspace-Tripmine\">[1]</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Subspace_Climbing\">Subspace Climbing</span></h2>\n<p>Subspace Climbing is a strategy that you can use to climb large walls. You begin by standing close to the wall. You then spam the mine while moving forward and jumping. Using an autoclicker can help with this process. If you use the strategy on a corner, it can make the process way easier.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902134900\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 69/2097152 bytes\nTem